      "definition": "Builder Project, urn:stdo:concept:world-model:builder-project, is a configured builder project instance with its own source inputs, settings and publication lane. Its Source Project relation is a directional specialization, not an unchanged import or general equivalence.",
      "exceptions": [],
      "grounding": [
        {
