t or exceeded mandate falsifies its predicate; missing support is indeterminate; invalid basis/interpretation or established scope/capability shortfall gets its corresponding diagnosis. Unresolved treatment retains actual standing including known failure. Publication does not establish statistical closure. Shared result/conjunction applies; lifecycle names, field values and evidence classes are not automatic verdict aliases.",
